Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That has got to be a new\Nworld record for butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the official\Nbutt cleaner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just a little bit of tar juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Yani!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your fucking mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mix up what Brent\Nwas doing again, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Screaming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, huh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like it's\Nsomebody's lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A little moist, but listen,\Na butt is a butt, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.68,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Nice! Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Soft kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, God, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What I write
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,down on the Mac
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Still wants to have a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this yummy new box of cigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But tiny problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:04:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A fresh pack of cigarettes\Ndoesn't have any gaps in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, in their natural form, these\Nlittle babies are packed in here to the brim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes about five cigarettes, and then\Nyou've got a perfect marshmallowy home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,for your cheapo lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, this is how every\Nsingle box of cigarettes should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're perfect, but oh so temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dang it, they packed this one\Npretty tight. It looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, a meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding the world's\Ncruelty is my superpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The three second rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't all get\Ncovered in sidewalk poo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's tight this month too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's fine if I\Njust cut off the tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,James Chainsmoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast Folk Temps, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes up here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what you all will\Nbe taking care of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, we prohibit all types\Nof tobacco products at our facility,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so we'll take that till your shift ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did number 56 go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's long gone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All that cat had was 30 more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the Beast Folk\Ngig worker helping today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The vase you'll be cleaning is\Nconsidered a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see a speck of dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't get your animal smell on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it possibly be dirtier\Nthan before you started cleaning it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And it smells like it's been sitting\Nin front of a disgusting train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You waste of space!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a whole hundred and seventy\Nyen to my name and six cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll be six days till\Nmy next part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to\Nlive on only 28 yen a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One cigarette every 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet I can just make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first and last of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When I smoke, I feel\Nlike I'm trouble-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, making it six days on 170 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess just a sig a\Nday is harder in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably easier to just go cold turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this always happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Always, always, always!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have zero freaking self-control!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm not perfect,\Nbut for fuck's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone up there is\Nstill looking out for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Yani? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wanted to see what you were\Nup to and hear your voices all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since\NI've seen you, so, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll want to come over and hang out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not get crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,True or false, your entire\Napartment smells awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The floors are totally\Nnot covered in ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just grab your phone\Nand send me a pic, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look at your pristine place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pristine it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just gotta start with gathering the\Ntrash, but I need a trash bag to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the stain on the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cover them up so I can start with the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,cigarette butts in the\Nmold colony in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad luck magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Half of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see a lot of smoking potential here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.23,0:10:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made me the happiest cat on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that right there is some good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She sent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who won fastest room cleanup today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:10:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the tidiest room I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A for effort, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When family starts making a stink,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then it might be time to try a\Nlittle harder to quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, reading can just fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And boop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If one works great, then\Nhow about more than one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't touched a\Ncigarette in three whole days?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The way you were smoking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd think your lungs survived\Non nicotine instead of oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No biggie. It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This has got to be the single\Ngreatest accomplishment of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Weeks day after new\Nbeers are so the bestest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm cheap smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is giving me good omen vibes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You need something, you walking ashtray?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just spreading all the good vibes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I need booze and I need\Ncigarettes, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go get me some?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm really trying to\Nfinish my work right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You little buckworm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All that learning making you\Nfeel like a big shot, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your head out of all these bucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The second you finish middle school,\Nyou're going straight to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I bust my hump to make sure you've\Ngot a roof over your freakin' head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think a kid would be\Ngrateful and get his old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,GOOSERIES!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe my own\Nfleshing blood would gang
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,up on me with a landlord\Nto tell me how much I reek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking a bath is nothing\Nmore than moist pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain up my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But once you get in the water,\Nyou do feel pretty refreshed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A bath's like a car wash for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I might be earning\Nmy clean freak badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The bath is the yin, and having a\Nsmoke afterwards is a tasty yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's chilly, and my throat hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, don't tell me I'm sick now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's definitely a cold
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes tastes like trash\Nso smoking is out the window
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take me sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely get through menthols.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.34,0:16:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You just had to run away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After I came all this\Nway to check up on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a secret agent\Nfrom the health department.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta admit, people don't\Nusually show up in hazmat suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, stop reeking of cigarettes then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And it is okay to clean up after yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes and garbage\Nmake a pretty stinky team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How bad are you feeling now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing a little better than yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go make you some Ray's porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She could be a little nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody made her come visit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that means she's got a\Nsoft spot for me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The porridge is ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Yani?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry. Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the mask. I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you fucking kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really, uh, stinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That actually hurts my feelings a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looky here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Howdy, Emoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kansai, hi, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for always looking\Nout for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sweet of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really that\Nthing's youngest sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis got some sort\Nof bug and feels gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And little sis doesn't\Nwant to get sick too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, coming all that way\Njust to help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would believe that thing\Ncould even catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny, but she's pretty\Ngood at catching a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Like when she eats 50\Npopsicles in one sitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Or jumps into the snow in her pajamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And when she gets sick, I\Nalways have to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not the easiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame you have to come all that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you out, all\Nyou gotta do is call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Appreciate the offer, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how much of a burden\Nshe can end up being sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So I think it's best for everyone if\NI'm the one who takes care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you adorable you're so\Ncute I could adapt you wait what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to die that's for certain
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got two months to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Could even make it three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a bit longer is possible, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,About a hundred days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred... cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Imoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare make my little sis cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's your lungs that\Nare making her cry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We all die one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty simple equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No smoking in the fucking\Nhospital, you goddamn beast folk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.52,0:20:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lung cancer in a hundred\Ndays was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I just, I wanted to chat, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's… Little sis…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:20:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna quit smoking for real this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost looks like cigarette smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
